 "unknowns": [
  {
   "configuration_id": "attocube_attodry800_basic_shroud",
   "key": "magnetic_field.max",
   "why": "Rejected not_available. The comparison-table row is accurate: on brochure p.11 the superconducting-magnet dots are only under attoDRY1000/2100/2200. But the attoDRY800 product page lists a vacuum-shroud option 'Customized Permanent Magnet Shroud' ('LT-APO configuration with ex-situ movable permanent magnet'). So a magnetic-field option exists, and the claim that the options list contains no magnet is wrong. At most this is optional_not_installed with an unknown value. not_available is not supported."
  },
  {
   "configuration_id": "attocube_attodry800_basic_shroud",
   "key": "sample.height.max",
   "why": "Honest unknown: the spec sheet, product page and brochure give only the 75 mm diameter, with customized heights as an option."
  }
 ],
